# Decode profile for the arena benches' `records sparse (dropped)` scenario: each Record keeps f1, f10
# and f20, the fields the streaming bench's `records sparse (stream)` reads, and drops the rest. Used
# by the C++ arena bench (CMakeLists.txt) and the Rust golden `bench_records_sparse`
# (tests/test_rustgen.cpp, rust/rapidproto-build/tests/goldens.rs).
name records_sparse

drop bench.Record.f2
drop bench.Record.f3
drop bench.Record.f4
drop bench.Record.f5
drop bench.Record.f6
drop bench.Record.f7
drop bench.Record.f8
drop bench.Record.f9
drop bench.Record.f11
drop bench.Record.f12
drop bench.Record.f13
drop bench.Record.f14
drop bench.Record.f15
drop bench.Record.s1
drop bench.Record.s2
drop bench.Record.f18
drop bench.Record.f19
